{
  "_notes": [
    "Company board_id/ats fields are unverified placeholders. Phase 2 resolves and verifies each company's actual ATS and board identifier against the live Greenhouse/Lever/Ashby/Comeet/Workable/SmartRecruiters APIs, and drops any company that doesn't resolve to a real board.",
    "This list is a starting seed of Israeli tech companies plausible for product/UX/UI design hiring, not a guarantee any of them currently has an open design role or even uses one of these ATS platforms."
